// BLADE RUSH animation library (hot reloaded).
//
// Poses are IK targets, not bone angles. Coordinates are RUF meters for a 1.8 m body:
//   x = character's RIGHT, y = UP, z = FORWARD.
//   hand / handL: weapon-hand targets relative to the chest (midpoint between shoulders),
//                 rotating with the torso. Shoulders sit at x = +/-0.17. Arm reach ~0.6.
//   blade / bladeL: direction the held weapon points (torso-relative).
//   footL / footR: ground positions relative to the character root.
//   yaw: + turns the torso right. pitch: + leans forward. roll: + leans right.
//   crouch: meters the pelvis drops. left: free | grip | guard | shield | weapon.
// Each strike has keys w (windup), i (impact, mid-swing), s (end of swing), f (follow-through).
// Timing comes from each attack's frame data (startup / active / recovery).
